flowchart LR
    Change[Completed change] --> Tests[Run checks]
    Tests --> Outcome{What did evidence show?}
    Outcome -->|PASS| Context[Save context + evidence]
    Outcome -->|FAIL| Fix[Explain + fix]
    Outcome -->|BLOCKED| Blocked[Record blocker]
    Fix --> Tests
    Context --> Return[Return outcome]
    Blocked --> Return
    Return --> Resume[Next request]
